flowchart LR
  D[Draft Request] --> V[Validate]
  V --> R[Resolve Approval Policy]
  R --> C[Conflict and Delegation Check]
  C --> P[Pending Approval]
  P --> A{Decision}
  A -->|Approve| X[Authorized Action]
  A -->|Reject| J[Rejected]
  A -->|Expire| E[Expired]
  X --> U[Immutable Audit and Notification]
  J --> U
  E --> U
